Interop test peer (interop/, not part of the module's packages)
---------------------------------------------------------------

The nested test-only module interop/ installs cpppo 5.2.5
(https://github.com/pjkundert/cpppo, Copyright Perry Kundert, GPL) from
PyPI into a Docker container on the tester's machine and runs its
EtherNet/IP server as a separate process. No cpppo source is included in
this repository or linked into this module; the image is not
distributed.

interop/pycomm3/Dockerfile installs pycomm3 1.2.16
(https://github.com/ottowayi/pycomm3, Copyright Ian Ottoway, MIT) from
PyPI into a python:3.12.10-slim image at test time; browse.py there is
our own script calling it. Nothing of pycomm3 is included here.

Test data
---------

Every tag name, value, serial number, address and product name in the
tests and examples is a made-up demo value.
